<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLO auction totals 22.205 billion Bfr.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLO auction totals 22.205 billion Bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the following details of the outcome of its monthly government bond auction -</p>
<p>6.25 pct, March 28, 2007 OLO  BE286=</p>
<p>    Lowest accepted (stop) price	    103.65</p>
<p>    Amount allotted				14.175 billion francs</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop		  100</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield		103.650 / 5.746 pct</p>
<p>8.75 pct, June 25 2002 OLO  BE259=</p>
<p>    Lowest accepted (stop) price	    117.70</p>
<p>    Amount allotted				 8.03 billion</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop		  29.71</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield		117.743 / 4.672 pct</p>
<p>    Non-competitive bids allottted:	 zero</p>
<p>Total amount allotted in both lines</p>
<p>    at non-comp, comp auctions:	     22.205 billion</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
